on tool, so I apologize if any parts sound unnatural. I really admire your art style and the way you handle dark tones in your works. Would it be possible for you to design an outfit for my female OC? The choice of colors and composition can be completely up to you — please feel free to create based on your impression of the character. \n\nThe setting is the Showa era. This female OC works as a nightclub hostess. At work, she is very talkative, witty, and full of charm, confidently displaying her femininity. However, in private she shows a contrast — sometimes melancholic, harboring feelings of self-loathing and despair. She grew up in an orphanage and has a frail younger sister. In order to support her sister’s illness, she started trying various jobs from a young age. \n\nI’m sorry that the reference image is only in black and white. Her hair and eye color are both black. Additionally, if possible, I would be delighted if you could also draw a chibi (super-deformed) version of this character. Of course, if that’s difficult, just the main illustration is perfectly fine. \n\nI apologize for troubling you during your busy schedule. It would be an honor if you could consider my request. Also, if the payment amount I offer is not suitable, I will be happy to adjust it.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1q-B6YC-dy3uf6k0N6NyvfRjsu8bSuzVj", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koji_sosaku/works/63", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c20886e0/uploads/origins/ae9a9d08-c3a3-4118-aa7b-d8f85539dfe0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=077ba73aec7b27e6a396ee43d55f0b07", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c20886e0/uploads/origins/ae9a9d08-c3a3-4118-aa7b-d8f85539dfe0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=077ba73aec7b27e6a396ee43d55f0b07, https://si.imgix.net/c20886e0/uploads/origins/ae9a9d08-c3a3-4118-aa7b-d8f85539dfe0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&cr